B.a6O=new A.cV("Chat","At the top is You: a chat with yourself, kept in your own Google Drive. Below it are your groups, and All files, which lists every file from your groups.",!1)
B.a73=new A.cV("Send","Pick a file or write a note, pick where it goes, then pick how it opens: One open, Watermarked or Traceable copies.",!1)
B.a6S=new A.cV("What needs an account","Nothing, to send a note or file that opens once, or to open a link or code. Your own chat and groups need you to sign in with Google.",!1)
B.a6M=new A.cV("Everything else","Your picture at the top opens your account. Settings has Activity, notifications and Help.",!1)
