B.aj_=s(["about","overview","start","what is this","purpose","tabs","navigation","where"],t.s)
B.a7v=new A.j7("what-is-no-sus","What NO SUS is","Two tabs. Chat is everything you keep. Send is everything you give away.",B.CG,B.adJ,B.aj_)
B.a6X=new A.cV("Where it lives","In a NO SUS folder in your own Google Drive. NO SUS can open only the files it creates there, so connecting does not let it see the rest of your Drive.",!1)
B.a6P=new A.cV("Adding to it","Open Chat, then You. Type a note or attach a file. You can also share something to NO SUS from another app: it opens Send with You already picked.",!1)
B.a7c=new A.cV("Before Drive is connected","What you add waits on this phone as Not saved yet, and is stored as soon as you connect.",!1)
B.aeg=s([B.a6X,B.a6P,B.a7c],t.eH)
B.alz=s(["saved","you","drive","google drive","notes to self","library","keep"],t.s)
B.a7u=new A.j7("no-sus-chat","NO SUS Chat","A chat with yourself for notes, links and files, kept in your own Google Drive.",B.v8,B.aeg,B.alz)
B.a6L=new A.cV("How","On the other screen, open nosus.foo/go. On your phone, open Chat, tap Open on any screen and scan the QR it shows. Match the number, then choose what that screen can open.",!1)
B.a7g=new A.cV("Your account stays on your phone","The other screen only gets the items you approve, and only while the session is open.",!1)
B.a70=new A.cV("After the session","Ending the session stops that screen from opening anything else. Files you downloaded or printed there can stay on it, so use a screen you trust.",!0)
B.aih=s([B.a6L,B.a7g,B.a70],t.eH)
B.akX=s(["go","computer","borrowed","laptop","qr","scan","print","desk"],t.s)
B.a7D=new A.j7("open-on-any-screen","Open on any screen","Open your own chat on a computer without signing in to Google there.",B.lk,B.aih,B.akX)
B.CQ=new A.aY(62293,"MaterialIcons",!0)
B.a6Z=new A.cV("What and where","Choose a file or write a note. Send it to You, to one of your groups, or to Anyone with a link. Anyone with a link needs no account to open it.",!1)
B.a6R=new A.cV("How it opens","For a link, turn on one of: One open, Watermarked, or Traceable copies. Each one says what it does right under it.",!1)
B.a6F=new A.cV("Opening a link or code","Send \u2192 Open a link or code. Codes work once and expire.",!1)
B.a7m=new A.cV("Sending nearby","Sending between two phones on the same Wi-Fi was removed. Send a link instead.",!1)
B.afV=s([B.a6Z,B.a6R,B.a6F,B.a7m],t.eH)
B.ajV=s(["share","send","link","share sheet","nearby","receive","address","drop"],t.s)
B.a7z=new A.j7("send","Send","One flow: what, where, how.",B.CQ,B.afV,B.ajV)
B.a7l=new A.cV("How it works","It is encrypted on your phone first. The key goes in the link, after the # sign, which browsers never send to a server. The first person to open the link gets it, and the stored copy is deleted.",!1)
B.a6U=new A.cV("Limits","Up to 10 files and 50 MB together in one link. A single file can also get a short code to type in. While that code is unused, a copy of the key is kept on our server for up to 20 minutes.",!1)
B.a78=new A.cV("It really is one open","If a chat app previews the link, that counts as the open. The person then sees that it was already opened, which tells you something got to it first.",!0)
B.agj=s([B.a7l,B.a6U,B.a78],t.eH)
B.ahq=s(["burn","burn note","burn file","secret","self destruct","one time","password","anonymous","size limit"],t.s)
B.a7y=new A.j7("one-open","One open","A note or file that is gone after the first person opens it. No account needed on either end.",B.CM,B.agj,B.ahq)
B.v3=new A.aY(61170,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a6E=new A.cV("How it works","Watermarked links are made from a file in one of your groups, so Send adds the file to a group first. You set how long the link works and how many times it can be opened.",!1)
B.a77=new A.cV("What you see","Each link has a log of when it was opened. You can revoke it at any time.",!1)
B.a6C=new A.cV("In a browser","A browser cannot block screenshots. The name on every page is what points back to the reader.",!0)
B.afF=s([B.a6E,B.a77,B.a6C],t.eH)
B.adP=s(["securesend","share link","access controls","expiry","view limit","revoke","analytics"],t.s)
B.a7B=new A.j7("watermarked","Watermarked","A link to one file that shows the reader\u2019s name on every page. You can revoke it.",B.v3,B.afF,B.adP)
B.a8z=new A.aY(63330,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a6Y=new A.cV("How it works","NO SUS makes one copy per reader, each with tiny wording changes that read the same. The note needs enough lines for the changes to fit; if it is too short, add a few more.",!1)
B.a6H=new A.cV("If it leaks","Paste the leaked text into the leak check on your note. It tells you which copy it came from.",!1)
B.a7_=new A.cV("Notes only for now","Traceable copies work with notes, not files.",!1)
B.a7a=new A.cV("What it can\u2019t catch","Someone who rewrites the text in their own words can remove the changes.",!0)
B.ajf=s([B.a6Y,B.a6H,B.a7_,B.a7a],t.eH)
B.alv=s(["canary","leak","trace","fingerprint","copies","who leaked"],t.s)
B.a7x=new A.j7("traceable-copies","Traceable copies","Each person gets a slightly different copy of a note. If it leaks, you\u2019ll know whose.",B.a8z,B.ajf,B.alv)
B.a8h=new A.aY(61657,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a7b=new A.cV("Joining","Chat \u2192 Join with a link, then paste the invite link or code. You see the group name and how many members it has before you join. There is no list of groups to browse.",!1)
B.a6N=new A.cV("Starting one","Chat \u2192 New group. You become its admin. You can turn on an 8-character invite code, or invite people only with links you make.",!1)
B.a6V=new A.cV("Leaving","Open the group \u2192 Group options (top right) \u2192 Leave group. Anything you added stays with the group.",!1)
B.a7j=new A.cV("Global Community","Every new account joins one shared group called Global Community. Treat it as public: anyone with a NO SUS account can read it. You can leave it like any other group.",!0)
B.ahW=s([B.a7b,B.a6N,B.a6V,B.a7j],t.eH)
B.an0=s(["community","join","invite","create group","leave","new group"],t.s)
B.a7s=new A.j7("groups","Groups","A group chat for files, with its own members and activity. You join by invite.",B.a8h,B.ahW,B.an0)
B.a7i=new A.cV("Members can","Read every file in the group, add their own, rename and delete what they added, and see the group\u2019s activity.",!1)
B.a76=new A.cV("Admins can also","Promote and demote members, remove and ban people, delete any file, manage invite links, and delete the group.",!1)
B.a7n=new A.cV("How it is enforced","By the database, not the app. The check runs on the server on every change, so an edited app gets a refusal, not a shortcut.",!1)
B.amI=s([B.a7i,B.a76,B.a7n],t.eH)
B.ahQ=s(["admin","member","permission","promote","demote","remove","ban","moderation"],t.s)
B.a7E=new A.j7("roles","Roles and permissions","Groups have admins and members. Admins manage people and files; members read and add.",B.CR,B.amI,B.ahQ)
B.a6D=new A.cV("Adding","Open a group \u2192 Add a group file, or Send a file to the group. Everyone in the group can read it.",!1)
B.a7k=new A.cV("Reading","Tap a file to open it in the protected viewer. Chat \u2192 All files lists every file from your groups.",!1)
B.a7o=new A.cV("Touch to reveal","The page stays blurred until you hold your finger on it, which stops the person behind you. Turn it off in Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security.",!1)
B.a7e=new A.cV("What this does not do","Group files are not end-to-end encrypted. They are stored on our server and access is checked by database rules. For that, send a One open link instead: it is encrypted on your phone.",!0)
B.alW=s([B.a6D,B.a7k,B.a7o,B.a7e],t.eH)
B.ag1=s(["file","upload","pdf","vault","all files","viewer","study desk"],t.s)
B.a7t=new A.j7("secure-documents","Files in groups","Files in a group open in the protected viewer, marked with the reader\u2019s name.",B.bK,B.alW,B.ag1)
B.a74=new A.cV("Watermarks","Your email and the time are drawn over every page you open. A photo of the screen carries them too, so a leaked page points back to who opened it.",!1)
B.a6z=new A.cV("Screenshot blocking is Android-only","On Android the app blocks screenshots and screen recording, and records the attempt. On the web and on iOS nothing can stop a screenshot. There, the watermark and the activity log protect you.",!0)
B.a6G=new A.cV("A camera always wins","No app can stop someone photographing their screen with another phone. These controls tell you who, after the fact.",!0)
B.ah_=s([B.a74,B.a6z,B.a6G],t.eH)
B.alO=s(["watermark","screenshot","screen record","capture","leak"],t.s)
B.a7w=new A.j7("watermarking","Watermarks and screenshots","Open files carry your name on screen, and on Android screenshots are blocked.",B.v3,B.ah_,B.alO)
B.a8i=new A.aY(61697,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a6W=new A.cV("What is recorded","Joins and leaves, files added, renamed, deleted and opened, screenshot attempts, and admin actions. It records who and when, never what a file says.",!1)
B.a6Q=new A.cV("Visible to everyone in the group","Members see what admins do as easily as admins see members. Nobody gets a private log.",!1)
B.a6A=new A.cV("Tamper evidence","Entries are chained, so removing or editing one breaks the chain. Nothing can be quietly taken back, including by admins.",!1)
